  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "しょうさいは　よく　わかっていない。モトトカゲに　にた　いんしょうだがはるかに　つよく　れいこくなのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "자세한 것은 잘 알려지지 않았다. 모토마를 닮았지만 그보다 훨씬 강하고 냉혹하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "詳情目前仍然不明。雖然給人貌似摩托蜥的印象，但力量和冷酷的程度可說是天壤之別。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On manque d’informations à son sujet. Il ressemble à Motorizard, mais en bien plus fort et cruel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es sind kaum Einzelheiten zu diesem Wesen bekannt, welches zwar Mopex ähnelt, aber weitaus stärker und grausamer ist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pese a las similitudes con los Cyclizar, es mucho más fuerte y despiadado que ellos. Está rodeado de incógnitas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Per lo più ancora sconosciuto, presenta similitudini con Cyclizar, ma è notevolmente più forte e spietato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Much remains unknown about this creature. It resembles Cyclizar, but it is far more ruthless and powerful.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "詳細は　よく　わかっていない。モトトカゲに　似た　印象だがはるかに　強く　冷酷なのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "关于它的详情尚且不明。与摩托蜥有着相似的印象，但强大与冷酷的程度远超摩托蜥。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pese a las similitudes con los Cyclizar, es mucho más fuerte y despiadado que ellos. Está rodeado de incógnitas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふるい　しょもつに　なが　あるテツノオロチらしい。　いかずちでだいちを　はいに　かえたという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오래된 서적에 “무쇠이무기”라는 이름으로 기록된 존재인 것 같다. 벼락으로 대지를 잿더미로 만들었다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠似乎就是古書裡所提及的鐵大蛇。傳說牠曾用雷電將大地化成了一片灰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il semble être le « Serpent-de-Fer » mentionné dans un livre ancien. Il aurait réduit la terre en cendres en la foudroyant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Offenbar ist dies das Objekt Eisenschlange, das in einer alten Schrift erwähnt wurde. Es soll das Land mit Blitzen zu Asche verwandelt haben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Parece tratarse de la criatura Ferromandra, que, según unos viejos escritos, transformó la tierra en cenizas con sus rayos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sembra che sia il Serpeferrea di cui si parla in un vecchio libro. Si dice che con i suoi fulmini abbia tramutato la terra in cenere.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This seems to be the Iron Serpent mentioned in an old book. The Iron Serpent is said to have turned the land to ash with its lightning.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "古い　書物に　名が　あるテツノオロチらしい。　雷で大地を　灰に　変えたという。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它似乎就是古老的书籍中提及的铁大蛇。传说它曾用雷电将大地变为灰烬。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Parece tratarse de la criatura Ferromandra, que, según unos viejos escritos, transformó la tierra en cenizas con sus rayos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
